    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... people always say things get better or there's a \"new chapter.\" but there isn't. how do you start a new chapter when the main character is dead? i feel like the person who mattered—the athlete, the competitor, the version of me that actually felt alive—that person is just gone. i'm just watching the credits roll on a movie that already ended. it feels less like a transition and more like a funeral that just won't end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
