      "content": "The pain you're feeling is real, but it's also a sign that your body is trying to protect you from a life that no longer fits. You're not alone in feeling this way, and there are people who can help you find a way forward. Please consider reaching out to a trusted friend, family member, or a mental health professional who can provide a safe space to share your experiences.",
