    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see a \"way forward\" when everything i was is everything i'm not anymore. it feels so empty. like, if the purpose is gone, then what's the point of just dragging this shell around? everything feels so finished, you know? like the story is actually done and i'm just... lingering.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
